; promotion seals (docs/ART.md 11.5): a round seal whose rim is the slot # (recoloured by the
; mapping to the family colour) around a glyph for the kind of line. Levels are drawn by ui.js
; (drawPromotion) as vellum pips on the lower rim. The sphere seals carry the sphere runes of
; realm.spr.

